# One Angle, Five Channels

## Client
Cymbiotika

## Product
Liposomal Vitamin C

## Source
Cymbiotika product page

## Original Copy Summary
The product is positioned as a liposomal Vitamin C formula designed
to support immune health, antioxidant protection and skin/collagen
support, with an emphasis on absorption.

## Chosen Marketing Angle

**Better absorption for everyday wellness support.**

The core angle remains the same across all five channels.
Only the length, tone and CTA are changed.

---

## 1. Sales Landing Page

### Headline
Vitamin C Designed for Better Absorption

### Copy
Give your daily wellness routine a smarter upgrade with liposomal
Vitamin C. Its liposomal delivery format is designed to support
absorption while providing everyday immune, antioxidant and
skin-support benefits.

### CTA
Shop Liposomal Vitamin C

