## 5. LinkedIn Post

Not all Vitamin C products approach absorption the same way.

One interesting approach is liposomal delivery — a format
designed to support absorption.

Cymbiotika combines this approach with everyday wellness,
antioxidant and skin-support benefits.

The bigger lesson for wellness brands: don't just communicate
what a product contains. Explain why the formulation and delivery
matter.

#Wellness #Marketing #Copywriting #HealthAndWellness

