## Channel Strategy

| Channel | Main Approach |
|---|---|
| Sales Landing Page | Detailed, benefit-focused |
| Meta Ad | Short, attention-grabbing |
| Google Display | Very concise |
| Cold Outreach | Personal and conversational |
| LinkedIn | Educational and native |

## Key Takeaway

The central angle stays consistent:

**Better absorption for everyday wellness support.**

The execution changes according to the channel.
